{"version":1,"content":"<p>《中年好聲音4》尹景順、許雲妮、鄭家聲、蔡宓婕、尤淑情、許美琪、吳亦偉、周志康、 陳旭培及鄭仲豪，昨晚（15日）舉行尾場《中年好聲音4越唱越強演唱會》，獲肥媽、張佳添、海兒，黑妹（李麗霞）、羅天宇、黃建東、李佳、顏志恒、顏米羔及劉威煌等捧場。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T11:00:00.589944+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T10:18:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T16:57:42.802295+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T10:57:40.807140+00:00","content_hash":"d762063830e5f2075c600d6b24247f9176731d20a736ea328742d395a5d5212a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}